---
layout: layout.njk
title: Choose a direction
description: Three homepage directions. None is locked.
section: Enter
bodyClass: page-chooser
---

<p class="kicker">{{ site.expansion }}</p>
<h1>Roundtable</h1>
<p class="lede">{{ site.productLine }} Question 12 is open. Open a direction.</p>
<p class="yale">{{ site.yaleLine }}</p>
<p class="door">{{ site.doorLine }}</p>

<div class="chooser" role="list">
  <a class="chooser-card" href="/room/" role="listitem">
    <p class="kicker">Direction A</p>
    <h2>Room</h2>
    <p>The product is the room. Four campus seats around one table.</p>
    <span class="btn">Open Room</span>
  </a>
  <a class="chooser-card" href="/map/" role="listitem">
    <p class="kicker">Direction B</p>
    <h2>Map</h2>
    <p>Local-first New York City, with Yale students joining from New Haven.</p>
    <span class="btn">Open Map</span>
  </a>
  <a class="chooser-card" href="/table/" role="listitem">
    <p class="kicker">Direction C</p>
    <h2>Table</h2>
    <p>The docket on the table. Information is the service.</p>
    <span class="btn">Open Table</span>
  </a>
</div>

<section class="stats" aria-label="What is on the table">
  <a href="/docket/"><strong>{{ pastSittings.length }}</strong><span>sittings sat</span></a>
  <a href="/offer-book/"><strong>{{ offers.length }}</strong><span>live offers</span></a>
  <a href="/benefits/"><strong>{{ benefits.length }}</strong><span>benefits</span></a>
  <a href="/brief/"><strong>{{ wire.length }}</strong><span>wire posts</span></a>
</section>

<section class="block dense">
  <h2>On the table now</h2>
  <ul class="quick">
    <li><a href="/docket/">Docket</a> — {{ pastSittings.length }} sat. Upcoming empty by design.</li>
    <li><a href="/offer-book/">Offer book</a> — {{ offers.length }} live, verified 2026-08-18. Ungated.</li>
    <li><a href="/brief/">Brief</a> — {{ wire.length }} posts, two lanes. GLM held.</li>
    <li><a href="/benefits/">Benefits</a> — {{ benefits.length }} in four time-to-value tiers.</li>
    <li><a href="/programs/">Programs</a> — {{ campusPrograms.length }} campus rows.</li>
    <li><a href="/labs/">Labs</a> — {{ labs.length }} on the watchlist.</li>
    <li><a href="/sitemap/">Atlas</a> — 43 pages in 12 sections.</li>
  </ul>
</section>
